OL,3,GNEWSAMan given life sentence after
OL,4,Apleading guilty to murder of Odhran
OL,5,AKelly
OL,6,
OL,7,FA County Armagh man has been given a
OL,8,Flife sentence for murdering a
OL,9,F23-year-old nursing student.
OL,11,FOdhran Kelly's body was found beside a
OL,12,Fburning car in Maple Court in Lurgan in
OL,13,FDecember 2023.
OL,15,FGary Damien Scullion, 34, was one of
OL,16,Ffive people arrested and charged in the
OL,17,Faftermath of the murder.
OL,19,FThe length of time Scullion will spend
OL,20,Fin prison will be determined at a later
OL,21,Fdate.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
